OL,3,AAlun Wyn Jones urges men to talk about 
OL,4,Ahair loss after transplant             
OL,6,FRugby legend Alun Wyn Jones has urged  
OL,7,Fmen to open up about hair loss, saying 
OL,8,Fhe was "very comfortable" talking about
OL,9,Fthe fact he has had a hair transplant. 
OL,11,FSpeaking one year since his operation, 
OL,12,Fthe former Wales and British and Irish 
OL,13,FLions captain said men typically do not
OL,14,Ftalk about the issue, but said "a lot  
OL,15,Fof people" had spoken to him about it. 
OL,17,F"I think it's important that people    
OL,18,Fknow there's a lot of people out there 
OL,19,Fthey can talk to," he said.            
